@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Création valide
POST {{base}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Bibliothèque principale","description":"Espace calme avec prises.","category":"LIBRARY","address":"Pavillon A, local A-210"}

### 2. Consultation (remplacer :id par l'id retourné)
GET {{base}}/places/:id

### 3. Persistance : redémarrer l'API puis refaire la requête 2 ou la liste
GET {{base}}/places

### 4. Propriété obligatoire absente -> 400
POST {{base}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sans adresse","description":"x","category":"LIBRARY"}

### 5. Valeur invalide (catégorie) -> 400
POST {{base}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test","description":"x","category":"INVALID","address":"A"}

### 6. Propriété inconnue -> 400
POST {{base}}/places
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Test","description":"x","category":"LIBRARY","address":"A","foo":"bar"}

### 7. Modification valide -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/places/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Nouvelle description"}

### 8. Champ contrôlé par le serveur -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/places/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{"averageRating":5,"reviewCount":99,"id":"abc"}

### 9. Doublon de nom -> 409 (rejouer la requête 1)
### 10. Id mal formé -> 400
GET {{base}}/places/abc

### 11. Publier une appréciation
POST {{base}}/places/:id/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"authorName":"Samira","rating":4,"comment":"Calme et Wi-Fi stable."}

### 12. Supprimer un endroit avec appréciations -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/places/:id

### 13. Mauvais Content-Type -> 415
POST {{base}}/places
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
